2. NASA POWER climate caches

   Normalized climate cache assets under backend/data/climate/cache/ are
   derived from the NASA POWER Daily API. The Registry of Open Data on AWS
   lists NASA POWER as CC BY 4.0 and requests citation. Credit the NASA POWER
   Project and retain the source/product provenance in the cache manifests.
   The NASA POWER acknowledgement is at:
   https://power.larc.nasa.gov/docs/acknowledgements/
   The registry entry is at:
   https://registry.opendata.aws/nasa-power/

3. BARC Crop Zoning portal captures

   Source captures under backend/app/data/source_captures/barc_crop_zoning/
   reproduce material from the Bangladesh Agricultural Research Council
   Crop Zoning portal. Its copyright policy permits reproduction without
   specific permission when material is reproduced accurately, is not used in
   a derogatory or misleading context, and prominently acknowledges the
   source. The captured policy and source manifest are included in that
   directory. Source: https://portal.cropzoning.gov.bd/.

